title: Forge_Upgrade
tags: structure interaction forge upgrade
---
<<jump Forge_UpgradeMenu>>
===

title: Forge_UpgradeMenu
tags: structure forge upgrade
---
<<if $forge_Level == 0>>
    Borin: Cold as a tomb in here. No ember, no edge. Get the fire lit and I'll craft you weapons worth the name.
    -> Ignite the Forge — 700 Wood / 450 Food. (Unlock weapon crafting.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "forge" 1>>
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Not yet.
        Borin: Then the anvil stays quiet, and so do I. Mind you don't dawdle.
<<elseif $forge_Level == 1>>
    Borin: The coals breathe again — good honest heat. Better bellows and a tighter draw, and I'll waste a deal less ore on every blade.
    -> Improved Smelting — 1300 Wood / 850 Food / 250 Crystal. (+10% Resource Efficiency.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "forge" 2>>
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeMenu>>
<<elseif $forge_Level == 2>>
    Borin: She's running hot and clean, the metal coming off like water. Teach me the deep-earth craft and not a scrap of good ore goes to slag.
    -> Master Metallurgy — 2600 Wood / 1700 Food / 650 Crystal. (+22% Resource Efficiency.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "forge" 3>>
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeMenu>>
<<elseif $forge_Level == 3>>
    Borin: The Forgefire wants to be born — I can feel it leaning at the flue, hungry. Stoke her once more and she'll arm our troops while we sleep.
    -> Forgefire — 5000 Wood / 3300 Food / 1300 Crystal. (Periodically supplies free high-tier troop equipment.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "forge" 4>>
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Forge_UpgradeMenu>>
<<else>>
    Borin: The Forge burns at its peak — a heart of living fire under Elarion's roof. Gear flows from her like a river, and she'll never run cold again. My work here is finished, and proud of it.
    -> She's a marvel, Borin.
        Borin: Aye. Granddad would've wept. Now go put her steel to use.
<<endif>>
===

title: Forge_UpgradeResult
tags: structure forge upgrade
---
Borin: <i>The flames flare and settle into a deeper roar.</i> There. Hear how she sings now? Done.
-> Back.
    <<jump Forge_UpgradeMenu>>
===
